        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">🔖 本文主攻专题速达：</span>
          <a href="/ranking/overall/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">机场推荐</a>
