          <a href="/ranking/value/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">性价比机场</a>
          <a href="/recommend/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">梯子推荐</a>
          <a href="/blog/self-hosted-vps-vs-commercial-airport-comparison/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">VPN科普</a>
          <a href="/recommend/stable/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">VPN机场</a>
          <a href="/glossary/what-is-vpn-node/" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700 hover:border-brand-300 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">VPN节点</a>
